      "path": "src/domain/trade-analysis/evaluate.ts",
      "content": "An Available underlying frame is accepted without checking that it is the option's underlying stock or belongs to the same valuation date/cutoff. For example, a XYZ option can use an ABC frame (or yesterday's XYZ frame) to report a breached stop and compute risk/reward and expiration payoff as Values. Validate the underlying instrument and temporal eligibility before using its Mark, including whether open lots were opened after its close, and return an appropriate Unavailable result when it cannot apply.",
